      "id": "a14c",
      "reviewed": true,
      "disposition": "corrected",
      "review": "All seven paragraphs, all fourteen conditions and both automatic duties read against raw XML. Distinctions checked between continuing obligation and performance deadline; damages, security and victim-fund payments; contact through intermediaries; abstinence and testing; care alternatives; automatic cooperation, electronic monitoring and judicial supervision order. Articles 14a, 14b, 14e, 23(1–2) and 24 checked as source cross-references.",
      "finding_and_resolution": "Corrected overly narrow description of the separate performance deadline. Added Schadefonds recipient, distinct financial caps and the limited scope of paragraph 5. Made identification/house visits/reporting and every paragraph-7 power explicit. Added precise limits on discretionary supervision conditions supported by two full HR judgments, including the insufficiency of willingness to cooperate.",
